            "title": "The dungeon",
            "summary": "Download (Zip ~28.4Mb) I created this graphic for the turn-based tactical game Baronsgate Tactics (Xenofant). Unfortunately, the project will not be released; it has been&hellip;",
            "content_html": "\n    <figure class=\"post__image post__image--wide\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/green.jpg\" height=\"640\" width=\"960\" alt=\"\" />\n      \n    </figure>\n\n  <p>\n    <b><a href=\"https://dragosha.com/free/assets/tiles.zip\">Download</a></b> (Zip ~28.4Mb)\n  </p>\n\n    <blockquote class=\"blockquote\">\n      CC BY. 4.0. Isometric dungeon tileset by Igor Suntsev is licensed under a <a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\">Creative Commons Attribution 4.0</a> International License.\n    </blockquote>\n\n    <h2 id=\"examples\">\n      Examples:\n    </h2>\n\n  <div  class=\"gallery-wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"gallery\" data-columns=\"3\">\n      <figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-04-20-19-35-59-adobe-flash-player-16.jpg\" data-size=\"798x476\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-04-20-19-35-59-adobe-flash-player-16-thumbnail.jpg\" height=\"458\" width=\"768\" alt=\"\" />\n      </a>\n      \n    </figure><figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-05-02-23-29-54-adobe-flash-player-16.jpg\" data-size=\"550x327\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-05-02-23-29-54-adobe-flash-player-16-thumbnail.jpg\" height=\"327\" width=\"550\" alt=\"\" />\n      </a>\n      \n    </figure><figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2014-07-31-16-56-30-xenofantfla.jpg\" data-size=\"800x480\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2014-07-31-16-56-30-xenofantfla-thumbnail.jpg\" height=\"461\" width=\"768\" alt=\"\" />\n      </a>\n      \n    </figure><figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-01-21-00-06-40-adobe-flash-player-11.jpg\" data-size=\"797x477\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-01-21-00-06-40-adobe-flash-player-11-thumbnail.jpg\" height=\"460\" width=\"768\" alt=\"\" />\n      </a>\n      \n    </figure><figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-02-05-19-03-47-skrinshot-ekrana.jpg\" data-size=\"729x383\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-02-05-19-03-47-skrinshot-ekrana-thumbnail.jpg\" height=\"383\" width=\"729\" alt=\"\" />\n      </a>\n      \n    </figure><figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-03-03-19-28-28-xenouifla.jpg\" data-size=\"792x472\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/gallery/2015-03-03-19-28-28-xenouifla-thumbnail.jpg\" height=\"458\" width=\"768\" alt=\"\" />\n      </a>\n      \n    </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <ul>\n    <li>about 400 originals images (at 288dpi)\n</li><li>floors, tiles, borders, objects, light\n</li><li>fire and doors animation</li>\n  </ul>\n\n    <figure class=\"post__image post__image--full\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/2017-12-30_23-53-02.jpg\" height=\"238\" width=\"920\" alt=\"\" />\n      \n    </figure>\n\n    <h4 id=\"11-high-resolution\">\n      1:1 High resolution:\n    </h4>\n\n    <figure class=\"post__image post__image--center\">\n      <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://dragosha.com/media/posts/13/tile21d.png\" height=\"364\" width=\"287\" alt=\"\" />\n      \n    </figure>\n\n  <p>\n    I created this graphic for the turn-based tactical game Baronsgate Tactics (Xenofant). Unfortunately, the project will not be released; it has been closed. This uses an unusual (non-mirrored) isometric projection. The graphics are available to use under a CC BY 4.0 licence.\n  </p>\n<div><div class=\"post__iframe\"><iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hT_tsDrzeXg?si=JuG-2CFw7sKQNNv8\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen></iframe></div></div>",
